["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"9. 加更英文原聲版：口述一部硅谷風投史 The Power Law Liberation Capital growth investing the strength of weak ties vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-12-30-zhangxiaojun-风投靠的不是眼光-是把一次性赌博变成可重复的游戏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d0a44507b6d3c62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>風投靠的不是眼光，是把一次性賭博變成可重複的遊戲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬拉比寫硅谷風投史，最值錢的一條機制是：風投用網絡把創業者的一次性賭博變成可重複的遊戲，所以他管風投叫「製造勇氣的機器」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"8. 和暢銷書作家馬拉比聊《The Power Law》：硅谷風投的起源、秘密和大人物肖像 The Power Law LP GP Vaporware 弱關係的強度\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-12-26-zhangxiaojun-红杉能长盛不衰-凯鹏华盈却掉队-差别在领导者管不管内部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5aa54d7a33404e0b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>紅杉能長盛不衰，凱鵬華盈卻掉隊：差別在領導者管不管內部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凱鵬華盈跌出榜首、紅杉持續領先，最大區別是領導者是否把精力花在內部管理上——如何招年輕投資人、如何培養、如何讓週一早晨那張決策桌保持活力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">紅杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"7. 和談婧聊：硅谷凍卵歷險記和Web3環球旅行 biological clock product market fit venture doubt Network States crypto house\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-25-zhangxiaojun-冻卵不是把青春取出来-是把浪费掉的卵子拿出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bf8ae5eb7e86050-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>凍卵不是把青春取出來，是把浪費掉的卵子拿出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性每個月排二十多個卵子只用一個，凍卵取的是原本被浪費掉的那批，不是提前透支未來的四百個——所以它不折損青春，反而把人生的截止日期挪掉了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">凍卵</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"6. 顯微鏡下的硅谷大裁員：一筆筆現實經濟賬 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁員補償 4+N/2：有綠卡是幸福，沒綠卡是倒計時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一場 Meta 裁員，有綠卡的人拿著十幾萬美金去新公司上班，沒綠卡的人要在四個月內、還是節假日窗口裡找到下一份工作，否則就得離開美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁員</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5. 和黃宇翔聊東南亞6國：政治、殺戮和國父 monarchy network indirect rule First Among Equals People Power Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-11-12-zhangxiaojun-东南亚的管制能力-多是屠杀和战争的副产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c0a370cf86c573-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>東南亞的管制能力，多是屠殺和戰爭的副產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投資東南亞先看政權能不能把政令推到最基層：這種管制能力，印尼來自一場屠殺後的清洗，越南來自十幾年戰爭，跟經濟增速無關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東南亞</span><span class=\"tag\">出海投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"4.【到全世界創業生活】尋訪越南：最後一個待開掘的儒家社會 儒家社會 亞洲四小龍 奧黛 朝陽大媽\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-18-zhangxiaojun-越南不会成为世界工厂-但可能是最后一个儒家新兴市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21038a22ff8cf135-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>越南不會成為世界工廠，但可能是最後一個儒家新興市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">越南人均 GDP 只有 3700 美金，相當於中國 2003 年。它的機會不是複製中國全產業鏈，而是像亞洲四小龍那樣選幾個行業做到發達國家水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">越南</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>不留空檔全面壓制：TikTok 花 100 億美元砸出護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是錢和一條暗號：幾年間投入約 100 億美元買量、補貼內容、砸服務器，對手要攔至少得準備 200 到 300 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字節跳動</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊貴的客戶，直到日活破億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推廣預算每個季度增長 100% 以上；Facebook 認定它留存太差、留不住用戶，反而把流量導給它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Apple WWDC Steve Jobs’ last keynote Mission Control Launchpad PhotoStream iTunes Match Notification Center\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2011-06-06-ch-applevideoarchive-乔布斯最后一次发布会-pc被降级-只是云端的一个设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84c8d5f0e521ef27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:58:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AppleVideoArchive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2011</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯最後一次發布會：PC被降級，只是雲端的一個設備</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯宣布：PC不再是存放照片、音樂和文件的數字中樞，這個角色現在要交給雲——iCloud讓所有設備自動同步，用戶甚至不需要打開任何同步軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">iCloud</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces unibody MacBook Pro &amp; MacBook (2008) unibody EPEAT Gold\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2008-10-14-ch-wim-speelt-hd-full-苹果造macbook的秘诀-从更厚的一整块铝开始-再削掉大半/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c877a66c45f4d8ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">52:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Wim Speelt Hd full</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2008</span></div>\n<h2>蘋果造MacBook的秘訣：從更厚的一整塊鋁開始，再削掉大半</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘋果發現：從更厚的一整塊鋁削出單一結構件，比拼接多個薄金屬件更輕更強；這套工藝後來被下放到降價700美元的入門款MacBook。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件設計</span><span class=\"tag\">一體成型工藝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"D5 2007: Steve Jobs interviewed by Walt Mossberg iTunes Plus OCAP AAC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-05-30-ch-video-insider-乔布斯说日本家电巨头做不好软件-这就是ipod和iphone能赢的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0c5421b726dec9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">53:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Video Insider</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯說日本家電巨頭做不好軟件，這就是iPod和iPhone能贏的原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯認為蘋果真正的護城河不是硬件，而是軟件能力差距——日本消費電子巨頭和手機廠商始終造不出像樣的軟件，這才是iPod和iPhone能贏的根本原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">iPhone</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces the first iPhone at Macworld 2007 --- REMASTERED and UPSCALED with AI to 4K multi-touch visual voicemail push IMAP cover flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-01-09-ch-debuggingthematrix-乔布斯定价iphone时的逻辑-别人的智能手机根本不是对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26dfdde48ab52c34-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">DebuggingTheMatrix</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯定價iPhone時的邏輯：別人的智能手機根本不是對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯把iPhone定價在和普通iPod同樣的499美元，理由是這臺機器集齊了別的手機要花幾百美元才能單獨買到的功能，卻一分錢溢價都沒加。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品發布</span><span class=\"tag\">定價策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; 2005 Stanford Commencement Address (with intro by President John Hennessy) Whole Earth Catalog\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2005-06-12-ch-stanford-乔布斯-被苹果开除-是我经历过最好的事情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12db0bcde8d71255-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2005</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯：被蘋果開除，是我經歷過最好的事情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">30歲被自己創立的公司公開解僱後，喬布斯才進入人生最有創造力的五年，催生了NeXT和Pixar,最終帶著那段技術重新回到蘋果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">職業挫折</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pixar&#x27;s early days: an interview with Steve Jobs (1996) Sillywood\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-11-22-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯说-pixar-权力结构是倒着的-ceo排在最底层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f32a8de44a1dc2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯說：Pixar 權力結構是倒著的，CEO排在最底層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為頂尖創意人才和頂尖圖形學人才都極度稀缺、隨時可能跳槽，喬布斯說 Pixar 的管理層必須倒著伺候他們，CEO反而成了最底層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才管理</span><span class=\"tag\">公司文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs: The Fresh Air Interview (1996) | Fresh Air object-oriented programming graphical user interface (GUI) blue box\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-02-22-freshair-乔布斯1996年预言-软件将彻底搬到网上下载-24个月内实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcc411a4204a4f9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">31:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1996年預言：軟件將徹底搬到網上下載，24個月內實現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">離開蘋果後喬布斯反思：Next做硬件是重走成功老路，沒看清世界已變——真正值錢的不是圖形界面本身，而是網絡和面向對象編程這兩件他79年在Xerox沒看懂的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">Next</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Building NeXT from the ground up (PBS &quot;Entrepreneurs&quot;, 1986) reality distortion simulated learning environments\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1986-01-01-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯的现实扭曲-被自己团队当面反驳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11ee91b1d295e29c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">20:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1986</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯的現實扭曲，被自己團隊當面反駁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這期NeXT內部錄像罕見捕捉到員工當面告訴喬布斯：他標誌性的現實扭曲套路一旦影響到產品設計決策，就是團隊日後返工重來的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Steve Jobs</span><span class=\"tag\">NeXT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs presentation, around 1980 (Computer History Museum, gift of Regis McKenna) VisiCalc fictitious business name statement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1980-01-01-ch-computer-history-museum-乔布斯1980年演讲-苹果的使命是消灭人机之间的学习门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21aabaf2fa470162-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Computer History Museum</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1980</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1980年演講：蘋果的使命是消滅人機之間的學習門檻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯認為蘋果真正要賣的不是硬件和軟件的數量，而是讓任何不懂編程的人都能直接解決問題，他相信這個門檻會在未來36個月內被攻破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>"]